{"study_accession":"PRJNA816715","secondary_study_accession":"SRP364282","title":"Comprehensive identification of RNA transcripts and construction of RNA networks in chronic obstructive pulmonary disease","description":"Here, we report a comprehensive analysis of dysregulated mRNAs, lncRNAs, miRNAs and circRNAs in peripheral blood of COPD patients with high-throughput RNA sequencing. We mapped about 50~80 million sequence reads per sample to the human genome. GSEA analysis showed that these dysregulated RNAs correlate with several critical biological processes such as RNA modification, and RNA metabolism. RT-qPCR (SYBR Green assays) with more clinical COPD samples were used for the validation of some dysregulated RNAs. We have also constructed the co-expression network between lncRNA and mRNA, and established the circRNA-miRNA-mRNA in CAC based on this data. This study provides valuable insights to understand the RNA involvement and regulation in COPD, assisting future COPD investigations. Overall design: Examination of mRNAs, lncRNAs, miRNAs and circRNAs in peripheral blood of COPD patients","pubmed":"35690768","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN26689031","study_accession":"PRJNA816715","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Normal_3_lnc","description":"Normal_3_lnc","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5956045","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-06-23","attributes":[["source_name","Human blood"],["tissue","Normal human blood"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR18337070","experiment_accession":"SRX14473316","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":52078219,"base_count":15623465700,"first_public":"2022-06-23","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM5956045: Normal_3_lnc Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN26689032","study_accession":"PRJNA816715","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","t